Hi Andrew,
 here are 10 patches for the NFSv4 server in 2.6-latested.
 Some relate to the "idmapper" which is used to map between textual
 identities (used by the protocol) and numerical identitied (i.e. uids).
 Others relate to better handling of replayed requests.

 All are purely nfsv4 which is still "Experimental" and should be as safe
 as the rest of the nfsv4 server code.

